al financial professionals to power their critical investment, dealmaking and advisory workflows. As of August 31, 2026, we had more than 9,200 clients and over 260,000 professionals using our solutions, including institutional asset managers, bankers, wealth managers, asset owners, partners, hedge fund professionals, corporate users, private equity and venture capital professionals, and market infrastructure participants. Our revenues are primarily derived from subscriptions to our multi-asset class data and solutions that include workstations, portfolio analytics, enterprise data solutions, and AI solutions. We also offer managed services that operate as an extension of our clients' internal teams to support data, performance, risk and reporting, and AI-enabled workflows.","zh":null}],"markets":[{"en":"Americas: The Americas segment primarily sells to clients in North, Central and South America. In the Americas, we have offices in eight states in the United States (\"U.S.\"). Additionally, we have data centers in two states in the U.S. and an office in each of Brazil and Canada. Revenues from the Americas represented 65% of total revenues during fiscal 2026.","zh":null},{"en":"EMEA: The EMEA segment primarily sells to clients in Europe, the Middle East and Africa via offices in Bulgaria, France, Germany, Italy, Latvia, Luxembourg, the Netherlands, Sweden, the United Arab Emirates and the United Kingdom (\"UK\"). Revenues from EMEA represented 24% of total revenues during fiscal 2026.","zh":null}],"customers":[],"competition":[],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2026-08-31","items":[{"name":"Americas","val":1617438000,"zh":"美洲"},{"name":"EMEA","val":605339000,"zh":"EMEA"},{"name":"Asia Pacific","val":253479000,"zh":"亞太"}],"total":2476256000},"geo":{"end":"2026-08-31","items":[{"name":"US","val":1516107000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"Other Countries","val":717565000,"zh":"其他國家"},{"name":"GB","val":242584000,"zh":"英國"}],"total":2476256000}},"peers":["JKHY","BRO","IT","MSCI","MKTX"]}